  id: Tape_05
  itemName: Tape number 5
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d41057f547fad874b812ae1b95212778, type: 3}
  prefab: {fileID: 131578805719098892, guid: acbc11eb9a5ca3d4ea76ea4e5c88f7ce, type: 3}
  isStackable: 0
  description: Tape 5 using tape5-fnaf sound
  recording: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a96054ee9dafb22439126e83b30e5465, type: 3}
  subtitles:
  - text: They are alive! They are not robots! I was doing my rounds in the Main
      Hall... checking the party tables.
    duration: 7.5
  - text: That's when I saw the Bunny. It looked at me! It smiled! Not a mechanical
      smile... a real one!
    duration: 8
  - text: I panicked. I tripped over a chair near the stage. I think my red master
      key slid under the tables... but I couldn't stop!
    duration: 10.5
  - text: I just ran! It chased me down the corridor.
    duration: 4
  - text: I tried to hide in the Ladies' Restroom to lock the door... but my hands
      were shaking so bad!
    duration: 7
  - text: I dropped the yellow maintenance key right by the sinks. I didn't pick
      it up. I just kept running.
    duration: 7
  - text: "The doors won't hold them forever. The power is draining too fast!\t"
    duration: 5
  - text: "I need to cut the main breaker. I\u2019m going to the <b><color=yellow>Storage
      Room</color></b>. God help me."
    duration: 7
